// ============================================================================
// tsconfig.test.json -- TypeScript settings for the Jest test run.
//
// Separate from tsconfig.json because tests legitimately need looser settings
// than shipped code: they import from `src/`, they use Jest globals, and they
// are not part of the published bundle.
//
// Right now it inherits everything and overrides nothing. Kept as a distinct
// file so that when tests do need a divergent setting, there is an obvious
// place for it that cannot leak into the production build.
//
// `"extends": "./tsconfig"` -- the `.json` extension is optional in an extends
// path. It resolves to ./tsconfig.json.
// ============================================================================
{
  "extends": "./tsconfig"
}
